   "text": "The Warriors face the Knights in an NRL semifinal at 6.05pm on Sunday evening at Eden Park.\nA club record crowd of around 48,000 is expected as the Warriors look to win for just the second time in seven attempts at the venue.\nThey have won six of their last seven against the Knights, who have come across the Tasman to New Zealand and beat them just twice in the last two decades, losing on the othe",
