   "textLength": 942,
   "text": "The winner on Sunday will travel to play the Penrith Panthers in a preliminary final next Sunday, with the Dolphins hosting the Sydney Roosters in the other preliminary final on Friday night.\nThe Dolphins beat the Warriors 26-16 in a qualifying final at Go Media Stadium last Saturday.\nFailing to make it to the preliminary finals would be disappointing for the Warriors, even when their injury list ",
